Third-party software
--------------------

Runtime dependencies (not bundled):

  * libcurl — client HTTP(S) (license: curl license / MIT-style)
  * json-c — JSON parsing (license: MIT)

Build-time dependencies include the Autotools toolchain, pkg-config, and
(optionally) the Check unit test framework.

Yamaha API documentation
------------------------

YXC API specification documents published by Yamaha are not redistributed
in this repository. Obtain them from Yamaha or your product documentation
if you need the official specs. The file docs/mcctl-api-coverage.md is a
project-maintained checklist only and is not a substitute for those documents.
